	(text "ADC1: PA0 temp; PA1 APPS1; PA2 APPS2; PA3 brake; PB0 steering; PB1 VIN.\nConfigure analog / no pulls; long acquisition time; reject implausible or stale inputs.\nVIN = ADC voltage x23. Require main input present before issuing torque commands.\nUSART1 AF7: PA9 TX / PA10 RX; PPS PA8 TIM1_CH1 AF6.\nSPI1 AF5: PA5/6/7; PA4 CS; PC4 EXTI4. FDCAN2 AF9: PB5 RX / PB6 TX.\nReceiving motor controllers must time out stale torque commands; enable MCU watchdog."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
